{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program' data-target='computer\/program' data-title='Program'>\r\n\t\t\tProgram\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd' data-target='computer\/program\/apache_httpd' data-title='Apache HTTPD'>\r\n\t\t\tApache HTTPD\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"The first VHost is the default one.","label":"VHost","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/ubuntu_layout","label":"Ubuntu layout","url":"\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/ubuntu_layout"},"nextArticle":null,"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<h2>00-default<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tThe first VHost is the default one.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>append _ to disable<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t?for others?\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>\/etc\/apache2\/sites-available\/<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>sites-available &gt; sites-enabled (symlink)<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;VirtualHost *:&lt;port&gt;&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tNote that though you can use domain name here - it actually effectively is an ip - hence for name based matching this should not be the domain name - and the interface ips instead.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tServerAdmin.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tServerName.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tUsed for name based matching.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tServerAlias.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDocumentRoot.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;Directory&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAllowOverride All.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tOrder allow,deny.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAllow from all.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRequire all granted.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t(only entry required for 2.4).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;Directory&gt; &lt;\/Directory&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>ErrorLog<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>ErrorLog CustomLog &lt;&gt; combined<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;\/VirtualHost&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/vhost\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/vhost\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/ubuntu_layout' data-target='computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/ubuntu_layout' data-title='Ubuntu layout' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>Ubuntu layout<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd' data-target='computer\/program\/apache_httpd' data-title='Apache HTTPD